  "problem": "$$\nU={5n-4∣\\,n\\in Z},\\,V={4,8,…,40}\n$$\n\nComplete the following reasoning about the sets $W$ and $V$ above:\n\nSince $U$ is {{field-1}} and $V$ is {{field-2}}, we have that {{field-3}}.",
